# A card turns red when its agent needs you, for the site's needs-you box
# (site/get-started.html, "a row turns red, and you answer its agent") and
# a social reel. Three agents are at work; the third asks which colour the
# signup button should be, and its card turns red. It is shown, answered
# in its own terminal, and goes back to work, while the other two carry on.
# Film it with docs/demo/record.sh, then cut it with docs/demo/cut.sh;
# the steps are in docs/demo/README.md.
#
# The phone cut shows the cards, then the terminal below its first line,
# where the answer is typed, then the cards again. Captions say only what
# the picture shows.
# cut: site reached:needs_you-5 end answer-0.3
# cut: phone reached:needs_you-2.5 end
# cut: shot reached:needs_you-2.5 540 0 0
# cut: shot answer-0.7 600 576 158
# cut: shot answer+2.6 540 0 0
# cut: caption reached:needs_you-2.3 show:3+0.9 top A card turns red when an agent needs you.
# cut: caption answer-0.6 end bottom Answer it. The rest stay calm.
# cut: readme reached:needs_you-0.8 answer+1.6
# cut: sheet reached:needs_you-1.2 reached:needs_you+1.2 show:3+1.2 answer+1.6 end-1
Set Size 1024x640
Set Appearance light
Set Palette evergreen
Set Backdrop E9EBDF
Set TypingSpeed 120ms

Spawn @acme-api add rate limiting to the login endpoint
Spawn @acme-billing retry failed webhooks
Spawn @acme-web make the signup button stand out

Sleep 500ms
Show 1
# The third's question comes about half a minute after it started
# (cues.txt).
Wait needs_you 60s
Sleep 3s
Show 3
Sleep 2s
Answer "Green"
Wait working 20s
Sleep 4s
